flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Enter username and password/]
    B --> C[Find exact username and password match]
    U[(Browser localStorage: users)] --> C
    C --> D{Match found?}
    D -- No --> E[/Show login error/]
    E --> B
    D -- Yes --> F[Set currentUser and apply role menu]
    F --> G{Requested module allowed?}
    G -- No --> H[/Show permission toast/]
    H --> G
    G -- Yes --> I[Run Dashboard, Inventory, POS, Reports, or Accounts]
    I --> S[(Browser localStorage: products, sales, users)]
    S --> J[/Refresh screen/]
    J --> K{Logout?}
    K -- No --> G
    K -- Yes --> L([End session in memory])
